<title>JAPAN: NISSAN TO RAISE S.AFRICA OUTPUT BY AUTOMAKERS DEAL.</title>
<headline>NISSAN TO RAISE S.AFRICA OUTPUT BY AUTOMAKERS DEAL.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nissan Motor Co Ltd said on Friday it aims to boost output and sales in South Africa by buying a 50 percent stake in South African car maker Automakers Ltd .</p>
<p>&quot;Nissan intends to further solidify the foundations of its manufacturing and sales activities in the South African market that is projected to continue growing into the future,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
</text>
